deploy/aws
# The runpod/cloud-worker Dockerfile stages COPY these specific worker
# entrypoints (and the helpers they import) into the image at build time --
# see runtime/Dockerfile. Everything else here (the provider clients, the
# control-plane dispatch logic, tests) has no reason to be in the build
# context and stays excluded so an internal vendor choice never leaks into
# a published image.
deploy/gpu_providers
!deploy/gpu_providers/runpod_worker_entrypoint.py
!deploy/gpu_providers/cloud_worker_entrypoint.py
!deploy/gpu_providers/remote_source.py
!deploy/gpu_providers/progress.py
